{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Steam Store Description (English)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every night, the nightmares return.<br>Your room is no longer safe\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The moment you lie down on a strange bed and close your eyes,<br>you are no longer alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is this reality?<br>Or someone else\u2019s endless nightmare?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nightmare Defense</strong> blends horror, strategy, and the thrill of tower defense into a unique roguelike experience.<br>A little scary, a little funny\u2026 but dangerously addictive. Step into the nightmare!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fusion of <strong>Roguelike + Defense + Puzzle + Deckbuilding</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill your room with weapons and power them up through the <strong>merge system</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge to unleash automatic turrets and hold back swarms of monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck strategically and face ever-changing nightmares</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend successfully to survive\u2014get caught, and the nightmare begins again</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you escape this nightmare?<br><br><strong>Nightmare Defense</strong> \u2014 start now!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4022040?t=1758382827","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4022040?t=1758382827","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022040/9b4545418d09f258daef2ca8918b7c6735038c51/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758382827","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022040/9b4545418d09f258daef2ca8918b7c6735038c51/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758382827","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Steam Store Description (English)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every night, the nightmares return.<br>Your room is no longer safe\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The moment you lie down on a strange bed and close your eyes,<br>you are no longer alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is this reality?<br>Or someone else\u2019s endless nightmare?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nightmare Defense</strong> blends horror, strategy, and the thrill of tower defense into a unique roguelike experience.<br>A little scary, a little funny\u2026 but dangerously addictive. Step into the nightmare!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fusion of <strong>Roguelike + Defense + Puzzle + Deckbuilding</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill your room with weapons and power them up through the <strong>merge system</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge to unleash automatic turrets and hold back swarms of monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck strategically and face ever-changing nightmares</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend successfully to survive\u2014get caught, and the nightmare begins again</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you escape this nightmare?<br><br><strong>Nightmare Defense</strong> \u2014 start now!</p>","developers":["Enter the Game Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022040/0eab75fa3f77d2f808ef3172e18320f74e46ccac/header.jpg